1. Folded antipodal quotient attack
   label             even odd even_safe folded_witness danger witness_s
   initial              7   8   117/280              0  117/280         -
   single 16 gate       8   7   199/560              0  199/560         -
   best 8-ladder       14   1  101/6435       101/8580 101/25740    85/528
   min-cover seed       2   8     13/16      749/22880 17841/22880  191/1144
   S390 random near     8   7 1722092419/4919523840 499634498712509/12386254136256000 239762921345951/774140883516000   83/7800
   Folded parity is not a proof by itself: the initial and single-gate
   rows have zero folded witness mass, meaning the antipodal pair test
   can lose boundary-only information.  But when the fold does expose
   mass, it gives a literal quotient witness interval.  The useful
   target is therefore folded parity plus endpoint-leaf debt.

